  "summary_en": "Preprint showing through three experiments with Nao humanoid robots that an ethical-robot control architecture can be trivially altered to make competitive or aggressive robots. The authors argue that preventing misuse is beyond engineering and requires governance frameworks underpinned by legislation, with responsibility resting on humans.",
